    "original_requirement": "构建一个智能垃圾桶分类与满载提醒系统，使用两个接近传感器 D2、D3 分别检测可回收和其他垃圾投递口，一个超声波模块（Trig=D8，Echo=D9）检测桶内满载高度，TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）、蜂鸣器 D6、LED D13 和串口。系统分别统计两类投递次数并显示总次数；当满载程度超过阈值时停止计数并报警，串口输出 empty bin needed。按钮 D7 可在清空后复位。",
    "effective_requirement": "构建一个智能垃圾桶分类与满载提醒系统，使用两个接近传感器 D2、D3 分别检测可回收和其他垃圾投递口，一个超声波模块（Trig=D8，Echo=D9）检测桶内满载高度，TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）、蜂鸣器 D6、LED D13 和串口。系统分别统计两类投递次数并显示总次数；当满载程度超过阈值时停止计数并报警，串口输出 empty bin needed。按钮 D7 可在清空后复位。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D7\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D5\"}], \"serial\": {\"baud\": 9600, \"framing\": \"line_or_idle\", \"idle_timeout_ms\": 20}}\nSerial baud=9600; framing=line_or_idle; idle_timeout_ms=20.",
